OL,3,GNEWSAVulnerable teenager who went
OL,4,Amissing in Glasgow found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vulnerable teenager who went missing
OL,7,Ffrom Glasgow has been found.
OL,9,FHaroon Ali, 16, was last seen on Monday
OL,10,Fmorning.
OL,12,FOfficers raised concerns due to the low
OL,13,Ftemperatures and carried out extensive
OL,14,Fsearches in the area.
OL,16,FPolice Scotland confirmed the teenager
OL,17,Fhad been traced and thanked everyone
OL,18,Fwho shared information.
